                  <h2 class="text-h2 title-section reveal-text">
                  Four decades of building <span>India's tomorrow</span>
                  </h2>
                  <p> 
                     Founded on 15 August 1986, Priya Cement has been making cement that holds for four decades. 
                  </p>
                  <p>Priya Cement is the cement brand of RAIN CEMENTS LIMITED (RCL), a company built on a single founding belief: that India deserved cement it could trust. From a first plant commissioned in Suryapet, Telangana, RCL has spent four decades building that trust — bag by bag, structure by structure, state by state. From a homeowner laying a foundation for the first time to an infrastructure contractor delivering projects at industrial scale, Priya Cement has been the choice of builders who cannot afford to compromise.</p>

                 
               
