         <div class="aboutus-stand-inner">
            <div class="aboutus-stand-visual">
               <img src="~/Assets/images/aboutus/lion.webp" alt="" class="aboutus-stand-visual-img">
            </div>

            <div class="aboutus-stand-content">
               <div class="section-title-outer section-title-outer-start aboutus-stand-heading">
                  <h2 class="text-h2 title-section reveal-text">
                     What we <span>stand</span> for
                  </h2>
               </div>

               <div class="aboutus-stand-cards">
                  <article class="aboutus-stand-card">
                     <div class="inner-stand">
                        <span class="aboutus-stand-num text-ghost text-big leading-none" aria-hidden="true">01</span>
                        <span class="aboutus-stand-icon">
                           <img src="~/Assets/images/aboutus/ourvision-icon.svg" alt="" class="w-auto">
                        </span>
                     </div>
                     <h3 class="text-h4">Our vision</h3>
                     <p>To be India's most trusted provider of cement, renowned for producing quality products reliably and responsibly.</p>
                  </article>

                  <article class="aboutus-stand-card">
                     <div class="inner-stand">
                        <span class="aboutus-stand-num text-ghost text-big leading-none" aria-hidden="true">02</span>
                        <span class="aboutus-stand-icon">
                           <img src="~/Assets/images/aboutus/ourmission-icon.svg" alt="" class="w-auto">
                        </span>
                     </div>
                     <h3 class="text-h4">Our mission</h3>
                     <p>RAIN CEMENTS LIMITED is dedicated to producing high-quality cement that builds a stronger India, while delivering value to all our stakeholders, including our employees, shareholders, customers and the communities in which we live and work. At a time when both population and concern for sustainability are rising, we have prioritised our efforts to meet the needs of rapid urbanisation in India without compromising on our impact on the environment.</p>
                  </article>

                  <article class="aboutus-stand-card">
                     <div class="inner-stand">
                        <span class="aboutus-stand-num text-ghost text-big leading-none" aria-hidden="true">03</span>
                        <span class="aboutus-stand-icon">
                           <img src="~/Assets/images/aboutus/ourcommitment-icon.svg" alt="" class="w-auto">
                        </span>
                     </div>
                     <h3 class="text-h4">Our commitment</h3>
                     <p>Priya Cement is committed to delivering high-quality building solutions with integrity and responsibility. In doing so, it strives to create lasting value for its investors, employees, partners and the communities it serves.</p>
                  </article>
               </div>
            </div>
         </div>
      </div>
   </section>

   <section class="aboutus-leadership-section section-spacing">
      <div class="container">
         <div class="aboutus-leadership-inner">
            <div class="aboutus-leadership-quote" aria-hidden="true">
                  <div class="quote-vector1"> <img src="~/Assets/images/aboutus/quote-vector1.svg" alt="" class="w-auto"></div>
                  <div class="quote-vector2"> <img src="~/Assets/images/aboutus/quote-vector2.svg" alt="" class="w-auto"></div>
            </div>

            <div class="aboutus-leadership-content">
               <div class="section-title-outer section-title-outer-start aboutus-leadership-heading">
                  <h2 class="text-h2 title-section reveal-text aboutus-leadership-title">
                     A word from our <span>leadership</span>
                  </h2>
               </div>

               <div class="aboutus-leadership-row">
                  <div class="aboutus-leadership-photo">
                     <img src="~/Assets/images/aboutus/NSujithKumarReddy.webp" alt="N. Sujith Kumar Reddy" class="w-auto">
                  </div>
                  <div class="aboutus-leadership-copy">
                     <p>The story of Priya Cement is not the story of one brand. It's the story of the many who helped build the brand. And the many more who trusted it to build their dreams. Priya Cement has always stood for a simple but powerful promise: consistent strength. Every bag that leaves our plants carries this promise, earning the trust and loyalty of homebuilders, dealers, engineers, masons and businesses across seven states.</p>
                     <p>On Priya Cement's 40th anniversary, this strength finds a new roar. Our refreshed identity, marked by the lion in the logo, and the tagline ‘Strength That Roars’ reflects our confidence in our products and amplifies the ambitions of a fast-growing India.</p>
                     <p class="aboutus-leadership-name">N. Sujith Kumar Reddy</p>
                     <p class="aboutus-leadership-role">Managing Director</p>
                  </div>
               </div>
            </div>
         </div>
      </div>
   </section>

