      <!-- ============================================================
         TIMELINE CONTENT — edit this plain HTML to add/change slides.
         ============================================================ -->
      <div id="slidesData" class="hidden" aria-hidden="true">

      <article data-year="1980">
         <img src="@Url.Content("~/Assets/images/dummy-rectangle-slide.webp")" alt="">
         <h3>Where it began</h3>
         <p>Priya Cement's Unit I broke ground, laying the foundation for what would become a four-decade legacy of quality manufacturing.</p>
      </article>

      <article data-year="1985">
         <img src="@Url.Content("~/Assets/images/dummy-rectangle-slide.webp")" alt="">
         <h3>First dispatch</h3>
         <p>Unit I shipped its first commercial batch, establishing the dealer network that the brand still relies on today.</p>
      </article>

      <article data-year="1993">
         <img src="@Url.Content("~/Assets/images/dummy-rectangle-slide.webp")" alt="">
         <h3>Going green early</h3>
         <p>PPC production commenced at Unit I, incorporating fly ash from coal-fired power plants, making Priya Cement one of the early adopters of blended cement manufacturing in India.</p>
      </article>

      <article data-year="1999">
         <img src="@Url.Content("~/Assets/images/dummy-rectangle-slide.webp")" alt="">
         <h3>Scaling capacity</h3>
         <p>A major capacity expansion at Unit I doubled annual output, meeting rising demand from a booming construction sector.</p>
      </article>

      <article data-year="2004">
         <img src="@Url.Content("~/Assets/images/dummy-rectangle-slide.webp")" alt="">
         <h3>Unit II comes online</h3>
         <p>The second manufacturing plant began operations, marking the brand's expansion into a new region and doubling its footprint.</p>
      </article>

      <article data-year="2008">
         <img src="@Url.Content("~/Assets/images/dummy-rectangle-slide.webp")" alt="">
         <h3>Quality certification</h3>
         <p>Both plants achieved ISO 9001 certification, formalizing the quality standards that had defined the brand since day one.</p>
      </article>

      <article data-year="2010">
         <img src="@Url.Content("~/Assets/images/dummy-rectangle-slide.webp")" alt="">
         <h3>Automating the line</h3>
         <p>A plant-wide automation upgrade improved consistency and cut energy use per tonne of cement produced.</p>
      </article>

      <article data-year="2012">
         <img src="@Url.Content("~/Assets/images/dummy-rectangle-slide.webp")" alt="">
         <h3>Regional expansion</h3>
         <p>New distribution hubs opened across three neighboring states, shortening delivery times for dealers.</p>
      </article>

      <article data-year="2015">
         <img src="@Url.Content("~/Assets/images/dummy-rectangle-slide.webp")" alt="">
         <h3>Sustainability targets</h3>
         <p>Priya Cement set its first public sustainability targets, committing to reduced emissions across both units by 2030.</p>
      </article>

      <article data-year="2018">
         <img src="@Url.Content("~/Assets/images/dummy-rectangle-slide.webp")" alt="">
         <h3>Digital dispatch</h3>
         <p>A digital dispatch and logistics platform launched, cutting delivery times to dealers across the region.</p>
      </article>

      <article data-year="2020">
         <img src="@Url.Content("~/Assets/images/dummy-rectangle-slide.webp")" alt="">
         <h3>Weathering the storm</h3>
         <p>Despite global disruption, both plants maintained continuous operations, supporting essential infrastructure projects nationwide.</p>
      </article>

      <article data-year="2022">
         <img src="@Url.Content("~/Assets/images/dummy-rectangle-slide.webp")" alt="">
         <h3>Record output</h3>
         <p>Combined production from both units hit an all-time high, cementing the brand's position as a regional leader.</p>
      </article>

      <article data-year="2026">
         <img src="@Url.Content("~/Assets/images/dummy-rectangle-slide.webp")" alt="">
         <h3>Looking ahead</h3>
         <p>With a new low-carbon product line in development, the next chapter of the legacy is already underway.</p>
      </article>

